{C:81930600}{C:81958296A73400000000}You can attack even when you're the defending side.

{C:81958296A83400000000}The only difference is that your units don't advance when they attack.


{x00}

{C:81930600}{C:81958296C53A00000000}A unit that's spent its EN can't act.

{C:81958296BB3400000000}When that happens, you should use {C:819782830600}Return{C:819782830000} to send it back to the ship and replenish its EN.


{x00}

{C:81930600}{C:81958296BC3400000000}There's something you need to watch out for here.

{C:81958296BD3400000000}First, returning to the ship replenishes EN instantly, but it doesn't replenish HP.


{x00}
